      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>An unknown error occurred while processing the call in the AppFunctionService.</para>
          <para>This error is thrown when the service is connected in the remote application but an unexpected error is thrown from the bound application.</para>
          <para>This error is in the ERROR_CATEGORY_APP category.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appfunctions/AppFunctionException#ERROR_APP_UNKNOWN_ERROR" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.appfunctions.AppFunctionException.ERROR_APP_UNKNOWN_ERROR</code>.</a></format></para>
