        <summary>
          <para>The caller does not have the permission to execute an app function.</para>
          <para>This error is returned to the caller of AppFunctionManager.executeAppFunction if the caller does not have the necessary permission.</para>
          <para>This error is in the ERROR_CATEGORY_REQUEST_ERROR category.</para>
