        <summary>
          <para>The caller tried to execute a disabled app function.</para>
          <para>This error is returned to the caller of AppFunctionManager.executeAppFunction if the app function is considered disabled according to AppFunctionState.isEnabled.</para>
          <para>This error is in the ERROR_CATEGORY_REQUEST_ERROR category.</para>
